  m_text: "<size=24>- Mystery event is triggered, where random symbols appear \n  lit
    for one spin.\n- 3, 4, or 5 consecutive lit symbols in a horizontal line triggers
    \n  the Wheel Bonus.\n- 3, 4, and 5 lit symbols enable the MINI, MAJOR, \n  and
